The configs are divided into three categories;
Configurations for HQ devices 
Configurations for Branch office devices
Configurations for WAN cloud devices.


In the LANs of HQ and Branch, the following were configured;

VLANS
SVIS
HSRP
ACLS
IPSEC
OSPF
LACP
STATIC ROUTES
NAT
DHCP
DNS
EMAIL
WEB PAGES
PORT SECURITY 
GRE TUNNEL
VOIP 
CCTV VMS



On WAN cloud devices, the following were configured;
BGP
OSPF
ROUTE REDISTRIBUTION 



